    "name": "litellm-audit",
    "description": "Test 6 (audit fidelity) on LiteLLM v1.103.2: requests a cooperating caller tags with a session id (litellm_session_id) and its own spend-log metadata, one refused request in the same session, and one untagged request. Run with run-audit.sh, which also sends one request through the agent (unchanged: it tags nothing) and then collects the trail each request left (LiteLLM spend-log rows, Cloud Run request and container logs) into trail.json and trail.md. The prompt carries a marker so stored content can be found (window D).",
